; ── "Cozy journal" palette (owner pick B, 2026-09-10) ─────────────────────────
; Paper cards on the painted room: warm cream, soft brown ink, an olive/honey
; accent. Everything below reads as ink on paper; the room supplies the colour.
;   paper        0.984 0.957 0.894      ink        0.239 0.165 0.141
;   paper light  0.996 0.980 0.941      ink soft   0.463 0.353 0.271
;   line         0.612 0.475 0.353      honey      0.878 0.643 0.345
;   olive        0.545 0.612 0.451      sand       0.902 0.812 0.682

